Third-party components:

The prebuilt WebAssembly artifacts under wasm/dist/ embed the PHP interpreter,
which is distributed under the PHP License v3.01 (https://www.php.net/license/),
together with runtime glue generated by Emscripten (MIT / University of
Illinois/NCSA Open Source License). The feature patches under features/ are
diffs against php-src (PHP License v3.01) and are applied to a clean checkout
at build time. Those upstream licenses govern their respective portions.
